{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"sveltekit-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"SvelteKit Snippets","description":"Svelte 5 runes, components, load functions, form actions and endpoints.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Svelte","path":"snippets/svelte.json"},{"language":"TypeScript","path":"snippets/typescript.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/svelte.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"State rune\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svstate\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let ${1:count} = \\\\$state(${2:0});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"$state\"\n  },\n  \"Derived rune\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svderived\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let ${1:double} = \\\\$derived(${2:count} * 2);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"$derived\"\n  },\n  \"Effect rune\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sveffect\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\$effect(() => {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"$effect\"\n  },\n  \"Props rune\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svprops\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let { ${1:name}, ${2:children} } = \\\\$props();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"$props\"\n  },\n  \"Bindable\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svbind\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let { ${1:value} = \\\\$bindable() } = \\\\$props();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"$bindable\"\n  },\n  \"Each block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sveach\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{#each ${1:items} as ${2:item} (${2:item}.${3:id})}\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"{/each}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An each block\"\n  },\n  \"If block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svif\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{#if ${1:condition}}\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"{:else}\",\n      \"  \",\n      \"{/if}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An if block\"\n  },\n  \"Await block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svawait\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{#await ${1:promise}}\",\n      \"  <p>Loading</p>\",\n      \"{:then ${2:value}}\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"{:catch error}\",\n      \"  <p>{error.message}</p>\",\n      \"{/await}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An await block\"\n  },\n  \"Snippet\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svsnip\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{#snippet ${1:name}(${2:item})}\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"{/snippet}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A snippet block\"\n  },\n  \"Form with action\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svform\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<script>\",\n      \"  import { enhance } from '\\\\$app/forms';\",\n      \"</script>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<form method=\\\"POST\\\" use:enhance>\",\n      \"  <input name=\\\"${1:name}\\\">\",\n      \"  <button>${2:Save}</button>\",\n      \"</form>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A form using enhance\"\n  },\n  \"Page data\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svdata\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<script lang=\\\"ts\\\">\",\n      \"  let { data } = \\\\$props();\",\n      \"</script>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<h1>{data.${1:title}}</h1>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Use load data\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/typescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Page load\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"skload\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import type { PageLoad } from './\\\\$types';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export const load: PageLoad = async ({ fetch, params }) => {\",\n      \"  const res = await fetch(`/api/${1:items}`);\",\n      \"  return { ${1:items}: await res.json() };\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A +page.ts load function\"\n  },\n  \"Server load\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"skserver\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import type { PageServerLoad } from './\\\\$types';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export const load: PageServerLoad = async ({ locals, params }) => {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"  return {};\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A +page.server.ts load function\"\n  },\n  \"Form actions\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"skactions\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import type { Actions } from './\\\\$types';\",\n      \"import { fail } from '@sveltejs/kit';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export const actions: Actions = {\",\n      \"  default: async ({ request }) => {\",\n      \"    const data = await request.formData();\",\n      \"    const ${1:name} = data.get('${1:name}');\",\n      \"    if (!${1:name}) return fail(400, { ${1:name}, missing: true });\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"    return { success: true };\",\n      \"  },\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Form actions\"\n  },\n  \"Endpoint\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"skget\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { json } from '@sveltejs/kit';\",\n      \"import type { RequestHandler } from './\\\\$types';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"export const GET: RequestHandler = async () => {\",\n      \"  return json({ ${1:ok}: true });\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A +server.ts GET\"\n  },\n  \"Redirect\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"skredir\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { redirect } from '@sveltejs/kit';\",\n      \"\",\n      \"redirect(303, '${1:/}');\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"redirect\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# SvelteKit Snippets\n\nSvelte 5 runes, components, load functions, form actions and endpoints.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 16 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Svelte | `svstate` | $state |\n| Svelte | `svderived` | $derived |\n| Svelte | `sveffect` | $effect |\n| Svelte | `svprops` | $props |\n| Svelte | `svbind` | $bindable |\n| Svelte | `sveach` | An each block |\n| Svelte | `svif` | An if block |\n| Svelte | `svawait` | An await block |\n| Svelte | `svsnip` | A snippet block |\n| Svelte | `svform` | A form using enhance |\n| Svelte | `svdata` | Use load data |\n| TypeScript | `skload` | A +page.ts load function |\n| TypeScript | `skserver` | A +page.server.ts load function |\n| TypeScript | `skactions` | Form actions |\n| TypeScript | `skget` | A +server.ts GET |\n| TypeScript | `skredir` | redirect |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}